# Derived index files — regenerated from the epic, story and task files
# by pm_reindex, pm_commit, `projectman reindex` and indexer.ensure_fresh
# on the read path, so git never needs to carry them (US-PM-29).
# The patterns are unanchored: a hub's subproject stores under projects/
# are covered by this one file.
index.yaml
INDEX.md
INDEX-EPICS.md
INDEX-STORIES.md
INDEX-TASKS.md
